WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
Price snow by snowfall or by the hour.

00:00:03.867 --> 00:00:07.633
Open the pricing. The $ next to a snow plan.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:17.900
Two ways to bill. By snowfall: a price per storm by how much fell. By the hour: men × hours, plus truck, loader, salt and ice melt.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:23.333
Labor per man-hour. Each visit bills men × hours at this rate.

00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:28.067
Truck and loader. The plow truck and loader rates per hour.

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:36.500
Salt, ice melt, walks. Salt per ton and ice melt per bag (by what was used), and a price per visit for walks.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.367
By snowfall. Switch to snowfall pricing.

00:00:40.867 --> 00:00:50.333
Snowfall bands. A price per storm for each band (0" to 1.99", 2" to 3.99" …). The x removes a band.

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.700
Add a band. Adds the next band.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.567
Each inch over. Above the last band, this is added for every started inch.

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:08.200
Salt, calcium, walks. A price each time you salt or put down calcium, and per visit for walks (blank if included).

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:15.100
Save it. Save pricing keeps it; visits on this plan can then be billed. The tour doesn't press it.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:20.267
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:26.367
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
